# The Tomb of Aclazotz (CR 611.2a, 109.5): "you may cast a creature spell from your graveyard" - "you" is the Tomb's controller. Bot1 turns the Journal over on
# turn 1 (the {2} from two Moxen, the two Plains in hand discarded). On turn 2 Bot2 casts Black Lotus, Faithless Looting (discarding two Spectral Sailors) and
# a Lightning Bolt at Bot1, leaving five cards in their graveyard, and a Mox Sapphire. On turn 3 the Tomb taps, and once its ability has resolved Bot2, with the
# Sapphire untapped, holds priority at instant speed with a flash creature in their graveyard: the Sailor is refused them - the way is Bot1's alone.

